<title>FRANCE: Algeria's chemical firm posts $1.3 mln profit.</title>
<headline>Algeria's chemical firm posts $1.3 mln profit.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algerian state-owned chemical company, Entreprise nationale d'approvisionnment en produits chimiques, posted a 71.8 million dinars ($1.3 million) profit in 1995, the Algerian news agency APS said on Monday.</p>
<p>The company showed a turnover of 2.2 billion dinar ($40 million), said APS without giving comparative figures.</p>
<p>(1$=54 dinars)</p>
